- Check contrast for every text/background pair under WCAG 2.2 AA targets: 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text and meaningful non-text UI components. The default board squares have approximately 3.48:1 luminance contrast; still test coordinates, borders, indicators and piece edges independently.
